{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>CHAT CHAMPIONS</strong> is an interactive pixel battle simulator built for Twitch streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/extras/3c779837fa2250905431629cc89fd07b.poster.avif?t=1743786611\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/extras/3c779837fa2250905431629cc89fd07b.webm?t=1743786611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 TONS OF ENGAGING FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4c CHAT CHAMPIONS is <strong>built to engage your audience</strong>. Players use chat commands to heal, vote on wacky Battle Modifications, curse one another, give blessings, and more! Including a <strong>built-in progression system</strong>, your viewers will always have a reason to get excited about coming back for a battle. With skins, emotes, and yes, hats\u2122, which can be unlocked by spending in-game Gold at the Shop, players can <strong>customize their combatant</strong> and make their mark on the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 BUY IT AS A VIEWER AND RECEIVE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you aren't a streamer, purchasing Chat Champions and logging in via Twitch provides a bunch of bonuses which help you stand out from the crowd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Save</strong> your character across <strong>ALL Twitch channels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Complete <strong>quests</strong> to earn <strong>rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Play <strong>priority</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Highlighted</strong> name</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 100,000 Bonus</strong> <strong>Gold</strong> to spend on cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23eb Permanent <strong>15% XP boost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 CUSTOMIZABLE FOR YOUR STREAM </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Every detail of the battle is in your hands. From the GUI to the rules of engagement, CHAT CHAMPIONS allows you to <strong>fine-tune the game to your liking.</strong>\u00a0With <strong>custom chat commands</strong> and <strong>your channel's emotes featured in-game,</strong>\u00a0every aspect is tailored to your stream's vibe. With an automatic camera and randomly-generated levels, post-round content, and more, CHAT CHAMPIONS is <strong>perfect for those AFK moments</strong> because the game can run autonomously <strong>without any input required from the streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 COMMUNITY-DRIVEN ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 CHAT CHAMPIONS <strong>puts your viewers in control</strong>. Through interactive voting, viewers <strong>shape the outcome</strong> of battles, influence the environment, and create glorious pixelated chaos together. CHAT CHAMPIONS encourages <strong>collaboration and competition</strong>, making every stream a unique experience. With community goals and shared achievements, your audience will feel like an essential part of the action, fostering a <strong>vibrant and loyal community</strong> around your stream.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ten Stacks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/cf8df582c579164849117b45dd9976459c9b1906.jpg"},{"name":"Stab Happy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/97af98168763b714778d9215392c2bc633b439f6.jpg"},{"name":"En Garde","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/817fad1699aeaaa8e291702fd0911c917b0964a7.jpg"},{"name":"Super Pokey Sticks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/a540ca723968c1538a8141ad9bd9930a822459d0.jpg"},{"name":"Crossed Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/fbead63213015feea478c5760156af6abc613b86.jpg"},{"name":"Cave Brained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/493916afb162296a2e322451e6a0b85f2108dc3c.jpg"},{"name":"Everything Looks Like A Nail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/b69c48b49395aff2616b945d47c164e109c7f8c4.jpg"},{"name":"Limb Lobbers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/a0a5eab5e7b3acc273f50bea7da6075c886dbd12.jpg"},{"name":"Super Smashy Sticks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/6c5c71164bf496de116a9f01a35b9315426e7f6d.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Cry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1232060/4ccd4919cf4b84106e41d6882987b0405bdfac03.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1232060?t=1743786611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743786611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743786611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743786611","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_des