rong>\ud83d\udcb0 100,000 Bonus</strong> <strong>Gold</strong> to spend on cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23eb Permanent <strong>15% XP boost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 CUSTOMIZABLE FOR YOUR STREAM </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Every detail of the battle is in your hands. From the GUI to the rules of engagement, CHAT CHAMPIONS allows you to <strong>fine-tune the game to your liking.</strong>\u00a0With <strong>custom chat commands</strong> and <strong>your channel's emotes featured in-game,</strong>\u00a0every aspect is tailored to your stream's vibe. With an automatic camera and randomly-generated levels, post-round content, and more, CHAT CHAMPIONS is <strong>perfect for those AFK moments</strong> because the game can run autonomously <strong>without any input required from the streamer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 COMMUNITY-DRIVEN ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 CHAT CHAMPIONS <strong>puts your viewers in control</strong>. Through interactive voting, viewers <strong>shape the outcome</strong> of battles, influence the environment, and create glorious pixelated chaos together. CHAT CHAMPIONS encourages <strong>collaboration and competition</strong>, making every stream a unique experience. With community goals and shared achievements, your audience will feel like an essential part of the action, fostering a <strong>vibrant and loyal community</strong> around your stream.</p>","developers":["Fabio Biancarelli","FLEX$ Studios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Twitch ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232060/header.jpg?t=1743786611","is_free":false,"legal_notice